{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19072","headline":"奉和郑相公以考功十弟山姜花俯赐篇咏 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉和郑相公以考功十弟山姜花俯赐篇咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采撷黄姜蘂，封题青琐闱。\n共闻调膳日，正是退朝归。\n响爲纤筵发，情随彩翰飞。\n故将天下宝，万里与光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}